    "body": "@denysdovhan I'd be curious to hear what challenges you encountered with the Node.js implementation.\r\n\r\nWe plan to integrate semantic-release sometime soon, so a changelog should be available then as well. For the time being, you can take a look at our Project board: https://github.com/starship/starship/projects/1",
